      "title": "MEDICAL USE — DO NOT THROW OUT",
      "pages": [
        "MEDICAL USE\n\n02/25\nalcohol x1\nbandages x6\nsutures x2\npainkillers x4\n\n02/27\nantibiotics — 3 left\ndisinfectant LOW\n\n02/28\nneed clean sheets\nneed boiled water\n\n03/01\nDO NOT use whiskey for cleaning wounds unless we're out of everything else.\n\n— S.K."
      ]
    },
