      },
      "placement": "ground",
      "title": "SHOP RUN",
      "pages": [
        "11/01 — SHOP RUN\n\nMichael\nJune\nTerry\nCole\nEllis\n\nNeed:\n\n2 tires\nbattery\nbrake parts\noil\nbelts\nanything useful from the red sedan\n\nTake the van.\n\nBack before dark.\n\nNo hero shit. Get the parts and come home."
      ]
